  "title": "Kitchen Rich Norwegian Beef Stew",
  "description": "A rich and creamy Norwegian dish featuring mixed beef cuts, this stew is perfect for a cold winter night, and is prepared in an ayurvedic-sattvic friendly manner",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
